  message: "CANDIDATE FOR CLOSURE BY WI-nanom (Python pyright/SCIP multi-fidelity backend,\nfiled 2026-08-23 under owner direction). This item's LIVE gap -- attribute-chain\nreceivers carrying no module hint, so obj.deep.method() leaves the module slot\nas the \"external\" sentinel and catalogued method-kind sinks stay unmatchable --\nis precisely what a pyright-backed SCIP index resolves.\n\nNOT AN INSTRUCTION TO CLOSE ON THAT BASIS. Two things to check first, both\nraised here so a future reader does not skip them:\n(1) This item's own STATEMENT is about whether a calls edge is EMITTED at all,\n    and the title already records that the emission clause is REFUTED (the gap\n    moved L2 -> L3, receiver evidence). So the statement and the live defect\n    are about different links. Re-read and if necessary rewrite the statement\n    BEFORE closing; closing on the title would be closing on the wrong claim.\n(2) Behavioural evidence, per closure-evidence discipline: re-run this item's\n    own repro, not a proxy metric."  # d7ae
