  message: "PHASE 0 RE-VERIFICATION AT TIP, 2026-08-25, dev e41a655d6d. The re-titled item\nis ACCURATE at tip -- L2 (emission) stays refuted, L3 (module hint) is live.\n\n    obj.write(p)             -> python:external:0-0:write:unresolved  cc=method\n    obj.deep.chain.write(p)  -> python:external:0-0:write:unresolved  cc=method\n    os.remove(p)             -> python:os:0-0:remove:unresolved       cc=method  <- CONTROL\n    print(p)                 -> NO EDGE\n\nAttribute chains DO emit; the module slot is the 'external' placeholder, so a\ncatalogued method-kind sink reached that way is still unmatchable, and the\nbuiltin bare Name still emits nothing. Status unchanged: violated, on the L3\nclause. Phase 6 (recall), owner-gated on measurement 0005."  # 343c
- op: discuss  # ac59
